      <h2>The PrimeTurf approach</h2>
      <p>With years of experience in the installation and maintenance of residential and commercial artificial turf and AstroTurf, we deliver high-quality, long-lasting solutions tailored to your needs.</p>
      <p>We take pride in delivering neat, professional workmanship, reliable service and exceptional quality. From private homes and estates to businesses, schools, restaurants and sports facilities, we create outdoor spaces that are built to last and designed to impress.</p>

      <h2>Elevate your outdoor lifestyle</h2>
      <p>Specialising in premium artificial turf, putting greens and custom outdoor solutions, we transform ordinary spaces into extraordinary environments.</p>
      <p>Whether you are enhancing a residential garden or a commercial property, our expert team delivers tailored, high-quality installations designed to suit your lifestyle and vision. From outdoor living areas to indoor applications, we bring craftsmanship, beauty, functionality, lasting quality and attention to detail to every project.</p>

      <h2>Why choose artificial turf?</h2>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>No more watering or mowing.</li>
        <li>Pet-friendly and low maintenance.</li>
        <li>Beautiful, lush green lawns all year round.</li>
        <li>Premium estate-level finish.</li>
        <li>24-month workmanship warranty.</li>
        <li>6-year manufacturer’s warranty.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Already have artificial turf installed?</h2>
      <p>We don’t just install artificial turf. We also specialise in restoring and maintaining existing installations. Our professional cleaning, maintenance and refresh services help revive the appearance of your turf, leaving it clean, vibrant and as good as new.</p>
